flowchart LR
  %% diagram: flowpay
  subgraph WS["Workstation - flowpay/"]
    CC["claude - VS Code opened at the estate root<br/>estate CLAUDE.md - .claude/settings.json<br/>/impact-analysis - /architecture-sweep"]
    FP["flowpay/ - Python 3.12<br/>services/payments - charges, refunds, idempotency<br/>services/ledger - double-entry<br/>web/dashboard - TypeScript client lib<br/>git remote github.com/«org»/flowpay (private)"]
