  DDB -.->|"stream, NEW_AND_OLD_IMAGES"| SETB

  RULE["<b>The house rule, and the seeded bug</b><br/>money is integer cents at rest and on the wire<br/>services/payments/refunds.py remaining_refundable()<br/>computes in float dollars - the one place that breaks it"]
